Plan item 41b (the "fast heating" part of item 41).
- new module EgtRiseMonitor: how fast each EGT goes up, in C per second;
  sampled every 0.5 s and smoothed over about 1 s so thermocouple noise
  does not trip the alert; a sensor that stops working is forgotten
- new alert / GPPWM sensor 47 "EGT rise rate" = the fastest rising EGT
  (unexpected when no EGT works)
- output channel / log: EGT rise rate (fastest)
- TS lists updated, ve/afr blend axis label offset moved from 47 to 48
- 5 new tests

